abstract: >-
  Reproducibility materials accompanying the final resubmission of "Characterizing Weak-Label Disagreement in Indonesian Digital Public-Service Application Reviews: Transformer Sensitivity to Supervision-Source Choice". Version 1.1.0 preserves the original frozen v1.0.0 computational record and adds a separate versioned reproducibility addendum documenting post hoc sensitivity and diagnostic analyses reconstructed from preserved RQ4 test predictions and associated metadata. The original analytic samples, trained models, test predictions, primary RQ1-RQ4 estimates, frozen cohort, and train/validation/test assignments remain unchanged. The IGAR dataset is not redistributed in this package and remains available from Mendeley Data, Version 3, DOI 10.17632/7zryc6k76z.3.
